#. ja: アバラシア雲海の未踏破地域に到達、「<sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0>」を目指して航行します。
#. de: Abalathias Rückgrat erreicht. Nehme Kurs auf: <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0>.
#. fr: Montagnes d'Abalathia franchies. Mettons le cap vers “<sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0>”.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationPoint, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:1:0:0"
msgid "Abalathia's Spine reached. Plotting course to <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0>."
msgstr "Достигнут Хребет Абалатии. Прокладываем курс к <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0>."

#. ja: 「<sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0>」に初到達、探索を開始します。
#. de: <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0> erreicht. Beginne die Erstuntersuchung.
#. fr: “<capitalize><sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0></capitalize>” atteint. Commençons exploration préliminaire.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationPoint, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:2:0:0"
msgid "<sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0> reached. Commencing initial survey."
msgstr "Достигнуто место назначения: <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0>. Начинаем первичное обследование."

#. ja: 「<sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0>」に到達、探索を開始します。
#. de: <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0> erreicht. Beginne die Unter<shy>such<shy>ung.
#. fr: “<capitalize><sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0></capitalize>” atteint. Commençons exploration.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationPoint, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:3:0:0"
msgid "<sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0> reached. Commencing survey."
msgstr "Достигнуто место назначения: <sheet AirshipExplorationPoint $n1 0>. Начинаем обследование."

#. ja: 気流安定、絶好の条件……<string $s1>の「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」は十分です。
#. de: Keine Turbulenzen, ideale Flugbedingungen. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> der <i><string $s1></i> ist ausreichend für die Erkundung des Zielorts.
#. fr: Conditions de vol idéales... <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> suffisante.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:4:0:0"
msgid "No wind or turbulence detected. <i><string $s1></i> <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> sufficient for exploration."
msgstr "Ветра и турбулентности не обнаружены. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> <i><string $s1></i> достаточно для исследования."

#. ja: 強風発生……「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」は十分ですが、探索に影響が出ています。
#. de: Starker Wind. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> stabil, aber eine Beeinträchtigung der Erkundung ist möglich.
#. fr: Subissons vents violents... <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> suffisante, mais influence sur les opérations à craindre.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:5:0:0"
msgid "Experiencing high winds. Airship <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> unaffected, but exploratory capability may be slightly hindered."
msgstr "Сильный ветер. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> дирижабля не пострадала, но исследование может быть затруднено."

#. ja: 乱気流発生中……「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」は十分ですが、探索は非常に困難です。
#. de: Heftige Turbulenzen. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> stabil, aber eine starke Beeinträchtigung der Erkundung ist wahrscheinlich.
#. fr: Subissons violentes turbulences... <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> suffisante, mais conduite des opérations très difficile.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:6:0:0"
msgid "Experiencing violent turbulence. Airship <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> unaffected, but exploratory capability may be significantly hindered."
msgstr "Сильная турбулентность. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> дирижабля не пострадала, но исследование может быть значительно затруднено."

#. ja: 気流安定……「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」に問題はありません。
#. de: Keine Turbulenzen, Flug stabil. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> ist im Normalbereich.
#. fr: Aucune turbulence détectée... <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> normale.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:7:0:0"
msgid "No turbulence detected. Airship <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> normal."
msgstr "Турбулентности не обнаружено. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> дирижабля в норме."

#. ja: 強風発生……「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」に問題はありませんが、探索は非常に困難です。
#. de: Starker Wind. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> stabil, aber eine starke Beeinträchtigung der Erkundung ist wahrscheinlich.
#. fr: Subissons vents violents... <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> normale, mais conduite des opérations très difficile.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:8:0:0"
msgid "Experiencing high winds. Airship <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> normal, but exploratory capability may be significantly hindered."
msgstr "Сильный ветер. <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> дирижабля в норме, но исследование может быть значительно затруднено."

#. ja: 「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」に不安がある状態ですが、探索を強行します。
#. de: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> sinkend. Setze Erkundung bis zum Erreichen des Grenzwerts fort.
#. fr: L'aéronef connaît une perte de <lower><sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0></lower>. Poursuivons la conduite des opérations autant que possible.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:9:0:0"
msgid "Airship <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> dropping. Continuing exploration until rendered unable."
msgstr "<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> дирижабля снижается. Продолжаем исследование, пока это возможно."

#. ja: 良質な物を含む「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を発見、念入りに対象を選び回収を開始します。
#. de: Hochwertige <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1> entdeckt. Beginne Extraktion nach Auswahl der optimalen Probe.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></capitalize> de bonne qualité découvert<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if>s. Commençons extraction sélective.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:10:0:0"
msgid "Several high-quality <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> discovered. Commencing extraction upon determining ideal sample."
msgstr "Обнаружено несколько ценных <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>. Определяем лучший образец и начинаем сбор."

#. ja: 良質な物を含む「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を発見、回収を開始します。
#. de: Hochwertige <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1> entdeckt. Beginne Extraktion.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></capitalize> de bonne qualité découvert<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if>s. Commençons extraction.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:11:0:0"
msgid "High-quality <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> discovered. Commencing extraction."
msgstr "Обнаружены ценные <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1>. Начинаем сбор."

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を検知、回収を開始します。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1></capitalize> entdeckt. Beginne Extraktion.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></capitalize> découvert<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if>s. Commençons extraction.
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
