msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:12:0:0"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1></capitalize> discovered. Commencing extraction."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1></capitalize> обнаружен. Начинаем сбор."

#. ja: 見事に「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を検知、回収を開始します。
#. de: Vorzügliche <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1> entdeckt. Beginne Extraktion.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></capitalize> découvert<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if>s. Commençons extraction.
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:13:0:0"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1></capitalize> discovered. Commencing extraction."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1></capitalize> обнаружен. Начинаем сбор."

#. ja: 「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」を十分に活かし、回収量も満足な結果となりました！
#. de: Hervorragende Ausbeute aufgrund optimaler <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>!
#. fr: Mise en œuvre optimale de la <lower><sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0></lower> de l'appareil. Résultat d'extraction excellent.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:14:0:0"
msgid "Optimal <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> result in excellent extraction yield."
msgstr "Благодаря отличному <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> удалось собрать множество образцов!"

#. ja: 「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」を活かし、回収量もまずまずの結果となりました。
#. de: Gute Ausbeute aufgrund hoher <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>!
#. fr: Bonne mise en œuvre de la <lower><sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0></lower> de l'appareil. Résultat d'extraction plus que satisfaisant.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:15:0:0"
msgid "High <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> result in above-average extraction yield."
msgstr "Высокое <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> позволило собрать больше обычного."

#. ja: 「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」に対して、回収量は満足いかない結果となりました……。
#. de: Durchschnittliche Ausbeute aufgrund mittlerer <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>.
#. fr: Mise en œuvre normale de la <lower><sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0></lower> de l'appareil. Résultat d'extraction satisfaisant.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:16:0:0"
msgid "Normal <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> result in average extraction yield."
msgstr "При нормальном <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> собрали среднее количество образцов."

#. ja: 「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」を考えると、回収量は十分な結果となりました。
#. de: Unterdurchschnittliche Ausbeute aufgrund niedriger <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>.
#. fr: Mise en œuvre limitée de la <lower><sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0></lower> de l'appareil. Résultat d'extraction à peine satisfaisant.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:17:0:0"
msgid "Sub-normal <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> result in below-average extraction yield."
msgstr "Из-за пониженного <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> собрали меньше обычного."

#. ja: 「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」に対して、回収量は物足りない結果となりました……。
#. de: Mangelhafte Ausbeute aufgrund äußerst niedriger <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>.
#. fr: Mise en œuvre très limitée de la <lower><sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0></lower> de l'appareil. Résultat d'extraction insatisfaisant.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:18:0:0"
msgid "Low <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> result in disappointing extraction yield."
msgstr "Низкое <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> привело к неутешительному результату сбора."

#. ja: 「<sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>」を考えると、回収量は決して多くは望めません……。
#. de: Verschwindend geringe Ausbeute aufgrund minimaler <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0>.
#. fr: Mise en œuvre médiocre de la <lower><sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0></lower> de l'appareil. Résultat d'extraction très insatisfaisant.
#. macro: <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = AirshipExplorationParamType, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "AirshipExplorationLog:19:0:0"
msgid "Poor <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> result in extremely disappointing extraction yield."
msgstr "Из-за плохого <sheet AirshipExplorationParamType $n2 0> собрали совсем мало образцов."

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を<num $n2>個獲得しました！</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><capitalize><noun-de Item 1 $n1 $n2 4 1></capitalize> erhalten!</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
